  when has 2868
  zone Badlands
  tip Lucien Tosselwrench, beside Lotwil, trades for Patterned Bronze Bracers, a blacksmith's craft: this step shows only when you carry a pair.
  accept 716                          -- Lucien Tosselwrench, beside Lotwil
  turnin 716

